  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Support for civic observation of the 2024 Presidential Elections and Constitutional Referendum in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promo-LEX Association aims to conduct an Election Observation Mission in the context of Moldova&#x2019;s Presidential elections and Constitutional Referendum scheduled for October 20, 2024. The Mission will oversee the electoral process to ensure transparency, credibility, and democratic integrity, addressing key challenges such as social and political tensions, external influence from Russia, and political corruption.
Given the high stakes, particularly regarding Moldova&apos;s European integration, this observation mission will cover all election stages, from pre-election developments to post-election outcomes. Activities include recruiting and training a robust network of observers, analysing legal and socio-political contexts, and conducting both qualitative and quantitative monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
